"""
# MC/DC coverage: function_lowering.spl — lower_type, kernel params, attrs, field resolution

Target: src/compiler/50.mir/_MirLowering/function_lowering.spl
Direct calls on a fresh `MirLowering`; table state is set on the lowering.
Function-body decisions (lower_function / lower_block_expected) are in
`function_lowering_body_mcdc_spec.spl`; trace-gated decisions are in
`function_lowering_trace_mcdc_spec.spl`.

## Decision inventory (this file)

